  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 402.09 Certified tank remover",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 402.09 “Certified tank remover” means an individual who is certified by the International Code Council in UST system decommissioning and who has knowledge of federal UST regulations and industry standards.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400) #10393, eff 9-1-13; ss by #12643, eff 10-10-18 (formerly Env-Or 402.07) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400)",
